            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0062",
            "en_US": [
                "A plant site used as a playground\n",
                "for children and Pokémon."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0063",
            "en_US": [
                "You can go through hollows\n",
                "of fallen trees, too."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0064",
            "en_US": [
                "It is a popular place for tourists,\n",
                "but too harsh to be a resort."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0065",
            "en_US": [
                "Ancient ruins with a glorious history,\n",
                "buried in the sand as time went by."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0066",
            "en_US": [
                "A lot of collected products are\n",
                "stored at a constant temperature."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0067",
            "en_US": [
                "A cave where electrically charged\n",
                "stones float."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0068",
            "en_US": [
                "It has a reputation as a mine\n",
                "littered with valuable ore."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0069",
            "en_US": [
                "The oldest tower in the Unova\n",
                "region. No one knows its history."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0070",
            "en_US": [
                "These steep slopes are the last\n",
                "obstacle before the Pokémon League!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0071",
            "en_US": [
                "Legend says if you approach this\n",
                "big chasm, disasters surely follow."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0072",
            "en_US": [
                "An island symbol of hope for a world\n",
                "where humans and Pokémon live free."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0073",
            "en_US": [
                "Team Plasma's secret lab is located\n",
                "on a quiet little island."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0074",
            "en_US": [
                "This underwater pool grew from\n",
                "rainwater soaking into the ground."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0075",
            "en_US": [
                "A forgotten cave sealed with\n",
                "hints of a legend's presence."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0076",
            "en_US": [
                "A tall tower with a large bell whose\n",
                "tones are said to purify the spirit."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0077",
            "en_US": [
                "They say water collecting in hollows\n",
                "on the flat land created the moor."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0078",
            "en_US": [
                "People once lived in this village, and\n",
                "it still feels the same as it did then."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0079",
            "en_US": "A world-famous sea of shining waves."
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0080",
            "en_US": [
                "A mysterious forest where people get\n",
                "lost despite the simple landscape."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0081",
            "en_US": [
                "A small road by the shore, where you\n",
                "can enjoy the seascape in peace."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0082",
            "en_US": [
                "A pastoral road where novice\n",
                "Trainers can challenge one another."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0083",
            "en_US": [
                "A long and winding road with lots\n",
                "of ponds and tall grass."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0084",
            "en_US": [
                "A sandstorm delayed the road\n",
                "construction to connect two cities."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0085",
            "en_US": [
                "A busy road where\n",
                "performers gather."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0086",
            "en_US": [
                "A road with many trees\n",
                "for nature lovers."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0087",
            "en_US": [
                "Raised walkways help you\n",
                "avoid the tall grass."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0088",
            "en_US": [
                "It rains a lot here, and the marshy\n",
                "swamp holds many Pokémon."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0089",
            "en_US": [
                "This paved road attracts\n",
                "those who love bikes."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0090",
            "en_US": "Shopping Mall Nine",
            "flags": 112
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0091",
            "en_US": [
                "A road leading to the Badge Check\n",
                "Gates, chock full of showoffs."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0092",
            "en_US": [
                "Limpid streams carved beautiful\n",
                "scenery on this road."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0093",
            "en_US": [
                "A place of fun, where it's enjoyable\n",
                "just walking over its gentle hills."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0094",
            "en_US": [
                "This seaside route is famous for\n",
                "sand bars that cross the ocean."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0095",
            "en_US": [
                "A road covered with mist from\n",
                "the waterfalls."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0096",
            "en_US": [
                "A road whose sharp cliffs may scare\n",
                "some people off."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0097",
            "en_US": [
                "Many who visit Nimbasa City\n",
                "drop by to take a break."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0098",
            "en_US": [
                "The fast current here makes it\n",
                "difficult to surf."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0099",
            "en_US": [
                "Some researchers believe it was once\n",
                "contiguous with Desert Resort."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0100",
            "en_US": [
                "The biggest, longest bridge in Unova\n",
                "has four supporting towers."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0101",
            "en_US": [
                "A drawbridge raises and lowers,\n",
                "depending on the ship schedules."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0102",
            "en_US": [
                "A sturdy steel bridge that won't\n",
                "budge an inch when trains cross it."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0103",
            "en_US": [
                "An old bridge that settlers of the\n",
                "Unova region built and now live on."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0104",
            "en_US": [
                "The most advanced bridge in Unova,\n",
                "designed to soften any impact."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0105",
            "en_US": [
                "In the middle of the Unova region,\n",
                "it is a place of mysterious power."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a002_185_0106",
            "en_US": [
                "Trainers seeking further strength\n",
                "enter the cavern despite the risks."
            ]
